  <div class="prose-page">
    <p>
      PalmReadings AI was created to make palmistry more accessible, private, and grounded for modern life. We blend
      long-standing palm reading traditions with thoughtful digital analysis to offer clear, personal insights without the
      pressure, performance, or mysticism overload that often surrounds spiritual tools.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is not about predicting fixed outcomes or telling you who you are supposed to be. It’s about helping you
      understand the patterns you’re already living inside of. Your strengths, your tendencies, your blind spots, and the
      choices that shape where you’re headed.
    </p>

    <h2>A Modern Approach to an Ancient Practice</h2>
    <p>
      Palmistry has always been about observation, reflection, and interpretation. Our approach respects that foundation
      while updating how readings are delivered. By analyzing the structure, lines, and features of your hands through a
      guided digital process, we focus on consistency, clarity, and relevance.
    </p>
    <p>Each reading is designed to feel grounded and useful. No vague statements. No fear-based messaging. Just practical perspective you can actually sit with.</p>
    <p>
      We love palmistry and know that AI is not a full replacement for the true art. We aim to serve as a fun and helpful
      intermediary step, but highly recommend that you see in-person professionals for palm readings as well!
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy Comes First</h2>
    <p>
      PalmReadings AI is built for people who value discretion. Readings are delivered privately, without live sessions,
      public profiles, or social pressure. You can explore personal insights at your own pace, on your own terms.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not sell readings as entertainment or gimmicks. This is a reflective tool, meant to support self-awareness, not
      replace personal agency or professional guidance.
    </p>

    <h2>Why PalmReadings AI Exists</h2>
    <p>
      So many people turn to self-discovery tools when they’re at a crossroads, feeling stuck, or simply curious about
      themselves. We built PalmReadings AI to offer a calm, structured way to look inward without judgment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you’re exploring relationships, career direction, or personal patterns, our goal is to help you walk away with
      language for what you’re already sensing, and a clearer understanding of how you move through the world.
    </p>
    <p>
      PalmReadings AI exists to give you perspective, not answers. The insight is the starting point. What you do with it is
      always up to you.
    </p>
